    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce your way up  to the mysterious\u00a0<strong>Summit</strong>, where eternal pinball glory and an awesome gift await. This journey demands absolute mastery in the art of <strong>The Flipper</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE WARNED!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no typical pinball game. You must learn from every fall to  overcome this transformative challenge. Endure the climb and you may emerge a...\u00a0<strong>Pinball Wizard</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/a958dad89886013316e8f0947358f17b.poster.avif?t=1755086641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/a958dad89886013316e8f0947358f17b.webm?t=1755086641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/a958dad89886013316e8f0947358f17b.mp4?t=1755086641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, Accessible, One-Button Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You can play it with one finger!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of Challenging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Try to beat it before the refund window is over!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No  procedural generation here!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics Based Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It really makes you <strong>feel</strong>\u00a0like a pinball!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Checkpoints and Skipping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one will judge you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Themes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make your pinball a cat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nearly-Endless Suffering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At least the music is relaxing!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/f66e947d0faea5f619402bf425678689.poster.avif?t=1755086641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/f66e947d0faea5f619402bf425678689.webm?t=1755086641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/f66e947d0faea5f619402bf425678689.mp4?t=1755086641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was inspired by the momentum-based gameplay of &quot;Get To Work&quot; and the other legendary &quot;Foddian&quot; games that came before it. My goal was to provide a fresh take on the soul-testing magic I felt while playing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capsule art created by Elen Johnson -\u00a0elenmayart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce your way up  to the mysterious\u00a0<strong>Summit</strong>, where eternal pinball glory and an awesome gift await. This journey demands absolute mastery in the art of <strong>The Flipper</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE WARNED!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no typical pinball game. You must learn from every fall to  overcome this transformative challenge. Endure the climb and you may emerge a...\u00a0<strong>Pinball Wizard</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/a958dad89886013316e8f0947358f17b.poster.avif?t=1755086641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/a958dad89886013316e8f0947358f17b.webm?t=1755086641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/a958dad89886013316e8f0947358f17b.mp4?t=1755086641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, Accessible, One-Button Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You can play it with one finger!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of Challenging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Try to beat it before the refund window is over!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No  procedural generation here!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics Based Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It really makes you <strong>feel</strong>\u00a0like a pinball!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Checkpoints and Skipping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one will judge you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Themes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make your pinball a cat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nearly-Endless Suffering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At least the music is relaxing!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/f66e947d0faea5f619402bf425678689.poster.avif?t=1755086641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/f66e947d0faea5f619402bf425678689.webm?t=1755086641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/f66e947d0faea5f619402bf425678689.mp4?t=1755086641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was inspired by the momentum-based gameplay of &quot;Get To Work&quot; and the other legendary &quot;Foddian&quot; games that came before it. My goal was to provide a fresh take on the soul-testing magic I felt while playing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capsule art created by Elen Johnson -\u00a0elenmayart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
